{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585500/extras/a771c68cb46f0897d7d39c8de56be795.avif?t=1666020089\" width=616 height=210 /></span><br><br><strong>Ol' Dick Wilde here has been in pest control his whole cotton-pickin life. He\u2019s come up with a bunch a custom weapons to help ordinary folk out with all sorts a' nasty crittersl! If you got a problem with hungry piranhas, angry \u2018gators, or even a shark or two - Dick\u2019s the guy to call! </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585500/extras/51316df3ca9f7b313c9e7dd1e7f0f155.avif?t=1666020089\" width=600 height=97 /></span><br><strong>Go crazy with the homemade arsenal of Dick Wilde!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585500/extras/2773691fd19f164dd9775b7aff559627.avif?t=1666020089\" width=600 height=290 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585500/extras/f2f5e69971ec78f70a6ef868b17df9df.avif?t=1666020089\" width=600 height=97 /></span><br><strong>Progress though 9 unique levels in 3 different settings: swamp, tropical and northern!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585500/extras/23eec6a3f686f1ad057344ecf0b40692.avif?t=1666020089\" width=600 height=97 /></span><br><strong>Giant alligators, rabid piranhas, electric eel, charging sharks, bats and many more!</strong><br><strong>Have a hoedown by sharing the headset amongs friends and compete for the highscore! Who'll be the biggest hillbilly this year?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585500/extras/6c6fd0a50d119d2a05cf0de132b97bec.avif?t=1666020089\" width=600 height=97 /></span><br><strong>DEFEAT GIANT BOSS MONSTERS AT THE END OF EACH LEVEL! Can Dick really take on a three-story high turtle with a homemade Bow? Can you?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585500/extras/b486589fb2e87d927c955b3dac5c8c51.avif?t=1666020089\" width=600 height=97 /></span><br><strong>Local multiplayer VR has never been so much fun. Spectators have all the information they could need. It even comes with a complete pinball display!</strong><br><strong>Happy Huntin' Folks!</strong><br><br>**DISCLAIMER**<br><br>Bolverk games does not support animal cruelty in any way, nor do we endorse heavy substance abuse, weapon crafting or having a messy home in a swamp.<br><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR  and SynthesisVR.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"7f169b2285ecb248c7456c77635423bfccbe9519.jpg","localized_name":"Toxic But Tasty!","name":"Toxic But Tasty!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/585500/7f169b2285ecb248c7456c77635423bfccbe9519.jpg"},{"icon":"34c9d9280d1779d0d584d12872ad966eb2a31ef8.jpg","localized_name":"Hard To Hit, Easy To Hate","name":"Hard To Hit, Easy To Hate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/585500/34c9d9280d1779d0d584d12872ad966eb2a31ef8.jpg"},{"icon":"185e158f8b58196b6e45a4925c43769344831a02.jpg","localized_name":"Dragonfly, Dragondie!","name":"Dragonfly, Dragondie!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/585500/185e158f8b58196b6e45a4925c43769344831a02.jpg"},{"icon":"0861c03367d0d6d8bd015af2c5abc8a74022dd3b.jpg","localized_name":"Sharp Aimer","name":"Sharp Aimer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/585500/0861c03367d0d6d8bd015af2c5abc8a74022dd3b.jpg"},{"icon":"68fa32df9234ead